Subject: [PATCH 087/141] Add low-level optimization data structures and
 spatial primitives

- Introduce me.stella.antarctic package for high-performance primitives

- Add FastMath for branchless floor/ceil and bitwise coordinate packing

- Add CollisionBox for allocation-free AABB intersection and axis offset math

- Add FastVoxelCache for fast collision shape classification

- Add PrimitiveEntityList for zero-allocation entity buffer queries

- Add unit test coverage for math, collision, and voxel caching

